WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
Your eyes that look far off
into the distance

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
They're listening to the voice
within your heart

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
Embracing a still blue moon

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
Your strength to keep on running

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
Will open another new door for you

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you

00:52.750 --> 01:00.060
It's in such a moment that this world
will begin to stir

01:00.060 --> 01:03.690
What should we be searching for?

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
Send out your soul

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
We'll meet here again someday,
if that's the truth

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
What should we fix our gaze upon?

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
Let it go, let's believe in it

01:30.320 --> 01:33.590
Gonou, I love your hands.

01:33.590 --> 01:35.860
You have really beautiful hands
with long fingers.

01:35.860 --> 01:38.730
Is it weird to use the word
beautiful for a man?

01:38.730 --> 01:40.890
I'd have done anything for you.

01:44.500 --> 01:47.530
Let's go home, Kanan!
I'll protect you, so...

01:48.200 --> 01:51.000
No, Gonou. It's too late already.

01:58.850 --> 02:00.310
A dream...

02:02.080 --> 02:05.110
I've been pretending to
have forgotten it, but...

02:23.570 --> 02:27.570
And you have a scar on your
stomach, do you not?

02:28.580 --> 02:31.710
The wound that will never be healed
has begun to ache,

02:31.710 --> 02:33.340
Ever since I met that man.

02:34.950 --> 02:38.350
He's most likely someone who hates
me for what happened then.

02:38.350 --> 02:41.620
But why's he acting in such
a roundabout way?

02:42.720 --> 02:45.890
Gonou, I love your hands.

02:46.830 --> 02:49.130
The one and only love I couldn't save.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.930
I can't embrace anyone now,

02:51.930 --> 02:53.830
not with these hands
tainted by my sins.

02:54.600 --> 02:58.610
Man, you have a SHORT lifeline.

02:58.610 --> 03:00.110
You scared me!

03:00.110 --> 03:01.580
That's my line.

03:02.180 --> 03:04.740
I can't believe how easily
I snuck up behind you.

03:07.020 --> 03:09.020
So which one's the lifeline?

03:09.020 --> 03:10.620
Oh, the line right here.

03:10.620 --> 03:13.020
Oh, you're right. It's short.

03:13.020 --> 03:15.350
Mine goes all the way down
to my wrist.

03:17.990 --> 03:20.960
Did I happen to wake you up?

03:20.960 --> 03:23.690
Well, more like...

03:26.030 --> 03:29.900
I thought I'd get a good look
at your gloomy face.

03:32.510 --> 03:35.140
It's about him, right?
That fortune-teller?

03:37.010 --> 03:40.020
Yes, Chin Yisou...

03:40.020 --> 03:41.480
Ni hao!

03:42.480 --> 03:44.750
Ni hao, ni hao!

03:45.750 --> 03:47.620
Cho Gonou the murderer.

03:49.360 --> 03:52.360
Why does it know your old name?!

03:53.830 --> 03:57.030
A mah-jong piece? Chin Yisou!

03:57.030 --> 04:01.200
You seem to have forgotten,
so I'll make you remember.

04:01.200 --> 04:05.010
You'll never find peace anywhere,

04:05.010 --> 04:08.180
because you're a sinner.

04:08.180 --> 04:12.050
Damn thing's shooting its mouth off!
What the hell do you...

04:12.050 --> 04:15.180
I understand what you wish to tell me,

04:15.180 --> 04:18.850
but if you have business with me,

04:18.850 --> 04:21.050
why don't you come out
and speak for yourself?

04:22.960 --> 04:25.590
Yes, those are the eyes, Cho Gonou.

04:25.590 --> 04:28.430
That's your true face.

04:28.430 --> 04:29.900
You bastard!

04:31.230 --> 04:32.720
Quit fooling with us, scum-sucker!

04:33.670 --> 04:35.270
Come on, we're going back, Hakkai!

04:35.270 --> 04:36.740
We'd better stick together!

04:37.840 --> 04:39.310
Right!

04:40.310 --> 04:41.780
Gojyo, look out!

04:44.780 --> 04:46.610
Gojyo!

04:46.610 --> 04:48.170
That's for what you did to me.

04:50.890 --> 04:52.350
Damn puppet...

04:53.460 --> 04:55.390
Hakkai, what's going on?!

04:55.390 --> 04:56.860
Gojyo's been...

05:07.540 --> 05:13.270
Damn it! Something's crawling
through my veins!

05:13.270 --> 05:15.410
What is that?!

05:15.410 --> 05:16.780
What's happening?!

05:16.780 --> 05:16.910
It's a seed.
What's happening?!

05:16.910 --> 05:18.240
It's a seed.

05:18.880 --> 05:20.580
I buried a live seed in him

05:20.580 --> 05:22.920
that sucks blood and takes root
in the veins.

05:22.920 --> 05:24.390
What the heck is that?!

05:24.390 --> 05:27.510
Chin Yisou... It's his messenger.

05:28.190 --> 05:29.690
That bastard?

05:29.690 --> 05:31.530
Now, if you don't do
something quickly,

05:31.530 --> 05:35.030
he'll become just another tree
in the forest.

05:35.030 --> 05:38.500
The seed's buried right
next to his heart.

05:38.500 --> 05:40.200
What will you do, Cho Gonou?

05:41.670 --> 05:44.830
You bastard, what are you after?

05:46.370 --> 05:50.150
So fun! It's so fun, Cho Gonou!

05:50.150 --> 05:52.670
You hurry over here too.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.750
So that's what this is about.

05:56.750 --> 06:00.190
That demented bastard's
got quite a hobby.

06:00.190 --> 06:01.520
Sanzo...

06:01.520 --> 06:01.690
Goku, hold down Gojyo's arms.
Sanzo...

06:01.690 --> 06:03.850
Goku, hold down Gojyo's arms.

06:06.530 --> 06:08.000
Are you happy now, Chin Yisou?

06:09.000 --> 06:11.090
This is what you wanted, isn't it?!

06:13.270 --> 06:14.800
Sanzo, what're you doing?!

06:14.800 --> 06:17.970
Hakkai, close the wound
as soon as I shoot.

06:17.970 --> 06:20.380
Please wait, the target's too small!

06:20.380 --> 06:23.910
And the seed's right next
to his heart!

06:23.910 --> 06:25.570
I won't miss!

06:26.480 --> 06:29.780
If he dies because of this, it'll be
because his heart was too weak.

06:29.780 --> 06:33.620
You're pissing me off!
I ain't dying now!

06:34.290 --> 06:37.690
Shut your big mouth, or
you'll bite your tongue.

06:49.300 --> 06:50.930
The wound's closed.

06:51.670 --> 06:54.480
He's unconscious, but
his pulse is normal.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.600
Oh, that was bad for MY heart.

06:57.710 --> 06:59.370
It's my fault, isn't it?

07:00.750 --> 07:04.790
Chin Yisou's obviously after me.

07:04.790 --> 07:05.990
Quit it.

07:05.990 --> 07:06.550
But...
Quit it.

07:06.550 --> 07:07.520
But...
Shut up!

07:07.520 --> 07:08.020
But Sanzo...
Shut up!

07:08.020 --> 07:09.120
But Sanzo...

07:09.120 --> 07:14.430
Cool it! Losing it now is exactly
what he would've wanted!

07:17.270 --> 07:20.370
Hey! Goku, bring some water!

07:20.370 --> 07:22.200
Got it! Hakuryu, let's go!

07:23.740 --> 07:27.010
He doesn't seem to be getting
much sleep lately.

07:27.010 --> 07:28.480
I guess it's not surprising.

07:29.080 --> 07:32.310
Everything most likely went
just as he scripted.

07:32.310 --> 07:35.350
He aimed to bury the seed
right next to Gojyo's heart

07:35.350 --> 07:38.110
to make me shoot Gojyo
in front of Hakkai.

07:39.550 --> 07:42.250
Meaning, we played
right into his hands.

07:45.260 --> 07:49.060
I don't know what gave rise
to Chin Yisou's hatred,

07:49.060 --> 07:54.170
but it's obvious that what he wants
isn't to kill Hakkai.

07:54.170 --> 07:55.640
He wants to destroy Hakkai.

07:57.070 --> 07:58.810
Kanan...

07:58.810 --> 08:00.270
I love you.

08:01.110 --> 08:04.880
I found work. The pay
isn't all that good,

08:04.880 --> 08:07.040
but it'll be more than enough
for the two of us to live on.

08:07.680 --> 08:09.780
So, come live with me.

08:10.790 --> 08:15.120
Gonou, I guess neither of us
is alone anymore.

08:18.190 --> 08:19.820
Kanan, I'm home.

08:25.300 --> 08:26.770
Kanan...

08:27.370 --> 08:28.700
We had no other choice!

08:28.700 --> 08:29.600
There was no way we could win
against the likes of them!
We had no other choice!

08:29.600 --> 08:30.770
There was no way we could win
against the likes of them!
Hyakugan Maoh...

08:30.770 --> 08:32.310
He toys with women and then
in the end...
Hyakugan Maoh...

08:32.310 --> 08:33.110
He toys with women and then
in the end...
If we had not handed the woman over,
we would've all been killed.

08:33.110 --> 08:35.140
If we had not handed the woman over,
we would've all been killed.

08:35.140 --> 08:36.640
No one's ever come back alive.
Oh, Kanan, poor girl.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.670
Oh, Kanan, poor girl.

08:42.120 --> 08:43.610
Awake?

08:44.390 --> 08:45.650
Where are we?

08:45.650 --> 08:45.890
We're still in the forest. Less than
half a day has passed.
Where are we?

08:45.890 --> 08:49.090
We're still in the forest. Less than
half a day has passed.

08:49.090 --> 08:50.790
I see...

08:51.860 --> 08:54.660
Do you have any idea who that
demented fortune-teller is?

08:54.660 --> 08:58.530
No, but he knows about my past.

08:58.530 --> 09:01.700
And he knows your old name too.

09:01.700 --> 09:03.300
Yes...

09:03.300 --> 09:05.900
And he hates me.

09:07.040 --> 09:11.600
I've heard rumors of surviving members
of Hyakugan Maoh's clan.

09:12.310 --> 09:18.220
Hyakugan Maoh... I thought I'd
killed every last one of them.

09:18.220 --> 09:20.360
Well, you should've made sure.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.350
What kind of thing is that
for a monk to say?

09:22.990 --> 09:23.790
Gojyo...

09:23.790 --> 09:24.490
It's no good. I searched the whole
area, but the fog's too thick.
Gojyo...

09:24.490 --> 09:29.000
It's no good. I searched the whole
area, but the fog's too thick.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.430
Searched?

09:31.100 --> 09:34.300
Goku! Did something happen to Goku?!

09:34.300 --> 09:38.430
After you collapsed, he went to get
some water and disappeared.

09:39.310 --> 09:40.770
With Hakuryu.

09:41.540 --> 09:44.880
You stay here! You're the one
that bastard wants!

09:44.880 --> 09:46.380
You expect me to just sit here

09:46.380 --> 09:48.750
and watch more people get hurt
because of me?!

09:48.750 --> 09:51.010
There's a phrase, "Hold nothing."

09:51.790 --> 09:54.290
"If you meet the Buddha,
kill the Buddha."

09:54.290 --> 09:56.790
"If you meet your father,
kill your father."

09:56.790 --> 09:59.630
Free of everything,
not bound by anything,

09:59.630 --> 10:01.820
live your life just as it is.

10:04.770 --> 10:07.600
It's the one thing my
predecessor taught me.

10:10.370 --> 10:12.570
That's why I'll continue to kill

10:12.570 --> 10:14.700
all those who would stand in my way.

10:15.510 --> 10:18.810
Whose enemy that might be,
matters not at all.

10:19.780 --> 10:23.520
Now, if you got that, cool your head
and get back in shape.

10:23.520 --> 10:25.180
I have no need of excess baggage.

10:27.420 --> 10:28.890
Yes, Sir.

10:29.590 --> 10:31.830
So, what're we going to do?

10:31.830 --> 10:32.890
About what?

10:32.890 --> 10:33.330
The monkey, man, the monkey.
About what?

10:33.330 --> 10:34.630
The monkey, man, the monkey.

10:34.630 --> 10:37.700
Goku's missing, and
the fog isn't lifting.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.370
I guess nothing's going
our way right now.

10:39.370 --> 10:41.670
I just feel like we're on his
fortune-telling table,

10:41.670 --> 10:43.200
and I don't like it.

10:43.200 --> 10:46.000
If he gets any one of us, he wins.

10:47.510 --> 10:52.750
I ain't dying. I super-hate losing.

10:52.750 --> 10:55.450
Don't use super.

10:55.450 --> 10:57.710
Then what should I say? Hella-hate?

10:59.450 --> 11:04.060
Oh, there you are! I thought
I got left behind!

11:04.060 --> 11:05.130
Goku...

11:05.130 --> 11:05.560
You stupid monkey!
Goku...

11:05.560 --> 11:06.620
You stupid monkey!

11:07.630 --> 11:09.730
What the hell were you doing?!

11:09.730 --> 11:11.600
Ow! Owowow!

11:11.600 --> 11:14.370
I went to get water, but I got lost!

11:14.370 --> 11:17.810
Goku! You're all right!

11:17.810 --> 11:19.640
Hakkai...

11:19.640 --> 11:21.110
Thank goodness.

11:22.110 --> 11:24.610
Please don't make us worry so much.

11:24.610 --> 11:26.080
Yeah, sorry.

11:27.320 --> 11:28.780
Hey...

11:29.780 --> 11:31.650
Where's Hakuryu?

11:31.650 --> 11:33.920
Sorry, I lost track of him on the way.

11:34.690 --> 11:37.120
Don't worry, we'll find him
when the fog lifts.

11:37.930 --> 11:40.390
Come on, let's hurry up and get out
of this creepy forest.

11:41.300 --> 11:42.760
Goku...

11:48.670 --> 11:50.140
Sanzo?!

11:51.210 --> 11:53.470
What's gotten into you?! What is this?!

11:53.470 --> 11:55.110
Sanzo...

11:55.110 --> 11:56.640
What're you trying to pull?

11:56.640 --> 11:58.110
Sanzo...

11:58.680 --> 12:00.150
Come on, Sanzo.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.310
Sanzo!

12:04.790 --> 12:07.050
What's wrong, Sanzo?

12:07.050 --> 12:08.720
It's not you.

12:08.720 --> 12:11.290
The one I called for was
that stupid monkey.

12:11.290 --> 12:13.090
It's me, Sanzo!

12:13.090 --> 12:14.560
Let me tell you something.

12:15.330 --> 12:18.500
The only one allowed to
address me so familiarly

12:18.500 --> 12:20.020
is that stupid monkey.

12:34.880 --> 12:37.550
Come on out, Chin Yisou.

12:37.550 --> 12:40.350
Master Sanzo seems
to be quite enraged.

12:43.930 --> 12:47.430
The puppet was very well made.

12:48.530 --> 12:50.630
What gave it away?

12:50.630 --> 12:53.630
You didn't do your homework.

12:53.630 --> 12:56.030
The first thing he always
says is, "I'm hungry."

13:00.680 --> 13:02.400
"I'm hungry," is it?

13:03.480 --> 13:05.710
That's so hard.

13:05.710 --> 13:07.150
Where's Goku?

13:07.650 --> 13:11.290
Well, what do you think?

13:11.290 --> 13:14.890
Is he wandering around
somewhere in this fog?

13:14.890 --> 13:16.360
Or possibly...

13:28.040 --> 13:29.840
I won't miss next time.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.240
Where's Goku?

13:31.240 --> 13:31.340
Goodness, you're so impatient.
Where's Goku?

13:31.340 --> 13:33.670
Goodness, you're so impatient.

13:33.670 --> 13:36.180
Perhaps you're deficient in calcium.

13:36.180 --> 13:38.780
Why not just shoot me now?

13:38.780 --> 13:42.270
That is, of course, if you're able to.

13:46.020 --> 13:47.620
What the hell is this?!

13:47.620 --> 13:49.090
Centipedes?!

13:50.960 --> 13:54.800
Hyakugan Maoh was a
centipede demon.

13:54.800 --> 13:58.160
If you move too much, they'll
bite and poison you.

13:59.300 --> 14:01.540
If you get bitten by that
many centipedes,

14:01.540 --> 14:03.730
it could cost you your life.

14:07.110 --> 14:09.200
Are you still not sufficiently enraged?

14:09.940 --> 14:12.550
Now, take a good look

14:12.550 --> 14:14.720
at the son of the centipede bastard

14:14.720 --> 14:18.340
that raped and impregnated
the one you loved!

14:28.230 --> 14:30.600
The sound of rain is drumming
in my ears.

14:36.140 --> 14:39.240
Who the hell are you?

14:39.240 --> 14:40.970
The drumming is so loud.

14:45.880 --> 14:47.750
I think I might go crazy.

14:51.420 --> 14:54.620
Kanan! Kanan!

14:55.260 --> 14:56.660
Kanan!

14:56.660 --> 14:56.760
Gonou...
Kanan!

14:56.760 --> 14:58.390
Gonou...

14:58.390 --> 15:00.860
Gonou! Gonou!

15:00.860 --> 15:03.760
Thank goodness you're alive!

15:05.130 --> 15:07.760
I'm sorry for letting you
suffer like this.

15:08.770 --> 15:10.740
Let's go home, Kanan.

15:11.970 --> 15:13.440
I'll protect you, so...

15:16.180 --> 15:20.340
No, Gonou. It's too late already.

15:21.780 --> 15:23.480
Kanan! What are you...

15:25.150 --> 15:27.820
You see, in my belly,

15:27.820 --> 15:29.980
is that monster's child.

15:33.830 --> 15:36.090
Someone kill me...

15:37.400 --> 15:40.890
So, goodbye, Gonou.

15:45.540 --> 15:48.680
Kanan!

15:48.680 --> 15:50.650
Kill me.

15:50.650 --> 15:56.210
Was that your revenge?
Killing my entire clan?

15:57.390 --> 15:59.150
Or...

15:59.150 --> 16:01.560
Was it your sense of justice

16:01.560 --> 16:03.020
to protect mankind?

16:04.690 --> 16:10.560
Well, I don't dislike your almost
admirable hypocrisy.

16:11.800 --> 16:17.910
But only your disgrace and desire
to kill can comfort my soul.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.370
Don't you say another word.

16:20.310 --> 16:21.770
Your voice offends my ears.

16:23.010 --> 16:28.150
Would you like me to tell you two
of the three things I hate most?

16:28.150 --> 16:29.950
Please, I'd love to know.

16:29.950 --> 16:31.850
Sick bastards and worms!

16:31.850 --> 16:33.410
Makai Tenjou!

16:39.830 --> 16:43.820
I don't think I've been this close
to being pissed in a long time.

16:45.100 --> 16:48.690
Isn't that amazing? I'm usually
so mild-mannered.

16:50.100 --> 16:53.810
Oh, damn it! I messed up!

16:53.810 --> 16:55.580
My insides hurt,

16:55.580 --> 16:58.010
and my left leg is definitely
broken from the looks of it.

16:58.950 --> 17:00.740
I screwed up my landing after all.

17:02.020 --> 17:05.470
Chin Yisou... Who the hell is he?

17:06.320 --> 17:08.910
I've never had to run so desperately.

17:09.790 --> 17:13.190
I wonder what happened between
him and Hakkai?

17:17.130 --> 17:20.660
Hakuryu! You've been tracking
me down all this time?

17:21.940 --> 17:25.570
Good dragon! I'll never eat you,
no matter how hungry I get!

17:28.940 --> 17:30.430
Hakuryu...

17:32.780 --> 17:34.250
You're right.

17:37.180 --> 17:40.780
It's not cool to just wait
for help to come.

17:43.020 --> 17:45.010
Hey, you okay, Hakkai?

17:45.890 --> 17:49.360
Hakkai? Who is he?

17:49.360 --> 17:53.400
Hey, get a grip! YOU are Cho Hakkai!

17:53.400 --> 17:55.160
I'm all right.

17:57.970 --> 18:00.960
Your attack was quite effective.

18:03.040 --> 18:04.080
Bastard!

18:04.080 --> 18:04.550
Please, go ahead and shoot.
Bastard!

18:04.550 --> 18:06.380
Please, go ahead and shoot.

18:06.380 --> 18:09.940
Will you aim for the chest
like last time?

18:19.430 --> 18:21.360
Sorry for the wait.

18:21.360 --> 18:22.460
Goku!

18:22.460 --> 18:22.860
Took you long enough, you bastard!
Goku!

18:22.860 --> 18:24.730
Took you long enough, you bastard!

18:25.570 --> 18:28.770
Not like I had a choice!
My leg's broken!

18:28.770 --> 18:31.700
And I'm hungry too. It's the pits.

18:33.040 --> 18:34.310
That's it.

18:34.310 --> 18:34.510
He can't possibly be anyone
other than Goku.
That's it.

18:34.510 --> 18:37.850
He can't possibly be anyone
other than Goku.

18:37.850 --> 18:39.310
Hey...

18:40.080 --> 18:42.280
You stupid monkey!

18:45.950 --> 18:47.550
What was that for?!

18:48.190 --> 18:48.960
All right...

18:48.960 --> 18:49.690
It's not all right, you violent
droopy-eyes!
All right...

18:49.690 --> 18:51.530
It's not all right, you violent
droopy-eyes!

18:51.530 --> 18:53.760
If he's relieved, why doesn't he
just say so?

18:56.500 --> 19:00.400
My arm's all shattered.

19:01.270 --> 19:04.370
Doesn't this bastard feel any pain?!

19:04.370 --> 19:09.110
I suppose, but seeing your
sappy get-together

19:09.110 --> 19:14.210
takes me beyond my pain and makes
me feel sick to my stomach.

19:15.150 --> 19:17.170
He's finally shown his true colors.

19:17.890 --> 19:20.320
Sanzo, I still say he's weird.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.880
He doesn't smell like he's alive at all!

19:23.490 --> 19:25.490
What are you saying?

19:25.490 --> 19:28.600
He's hurt that badly and acts
like nothing's wrong.

19:28.600 --> 19:30.330
It's just not normal!

19:31.070 --> 19:35.070
Then what? Are you saying he's
a ghost or something?

19:35.070 --> 19:36.540
That's right!

19:37.170 --> 19:38.640
I remember now!

19:39.370 --> 19:41.930
That man I killed!

19:43.110 --> 19:46.750
I'm sure I killed him that time!

19:46.750 --> 19:51.720
Now, I think that's quite
enough idle chitchat.

19:51.720 --> 19:54.950
I gave it some thought, you see.

19:55.690 --> 19:59.430
How would I be able to
make you the happiest?

19:59.430 --> 20:01.900
The answer was very simple.

20:01.900 --> 20:05.600
Tormenting your little friends
would be most effective.

20:05.600 --> 20:07.160
That's really low!

20:08.370 --> 20:10.360
That's the greatest compliment.

20:13.240 --> 20:19.210
I've had fun with the red-haired young
man and the golden-eyed boy.

20:19.210 --> 20:20.680
Next...

20:27.450 --> 20:31.320
He's really going to lose some
of his little friends.

20:32.930 --> 20:34.390
You just try it.

20:39.030 --> 20:45.440
That's right, even sudden
tragedies come

20:45.440 --> 20:50.810
Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion

20:50.810 --> 20:56.320
Don't complain, just shut up

20:56.320 --> 20:59.720
And look up

20:59.720 --> 21:05.530
I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is

21:05.530 --> 21:10.930
Before any talk of dreams or hopes

21:10.930 --> 21:16.270
It's probably the same for everyone

21:16.270 --> 21:20.210
You must fight against yourself

21:27.180 --> 21:30.850
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:30.850 --> 21:32.820
Repeating is one change

21:32.820 --> 21:36.920
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:36.920 --> 21:41.060
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:41.060 --> 21:43.730
Go forward now

21:43.730 --> 21:48.800
Standing next to the taut pressure

21:48.800 --> 21:54.210
I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone

21:54.210 --> 21:59.610
It's probably the same for everyone

21:59.610 --> 22:03.670
You must fight against yourself
